00:22:50.640 --> 00:22:56.080
A word to my dear mother

00:22:56.080 --> 00:23:01.490
boku wa genki de yattemasu

00:22:56.080 --> 00:23:01.490
Tell her that I'm doing fine

00:23:01.490 --> 00:23:06.950
kaban ippai no

00:23:01.490 --> 00:23:06.950
And that my bag filled

00:23:06.950 --> 00:23:12.580
nozomi to yume to takaramono

00:23:06.950 --> 00:23:12.580
With hopes, dreams and treasures

00:23:12.580 --> 00:23:18.440
kakaete kaeritai

00:23:12.580 --> 00:23:18.440
Will be brought back

00:23:19.530 --> 00:23:25.030
yuuyake wo senaka ni

00:23:19.530 --> 00:23:25.030
The sunset on my back

00:23:25.030 --> 00:23:30.920
kamome wo kata ni tomarasete

00:23:25.030 --> 00:23:30.920
And a seagull perched on my shoulder

00:23:30.920 --> 00:23:40.640
boku wa fukimasu kuchibue wo

00:23:30.920 --> 00:23:40.640
I blow out a whistle

00:23:45.820 --> 00:23:47.780
The treasure hunt has begun.

00:23:47.780 --> 00:23:52.700
Will it be Silver's gang of pirates who find the treasure? Or will it be us?

00:23:52.700 --> 00:23:56.390
Whatever the outcome, the path that leads to the treasure has its dangers.

00:23:56.390 --> 00:23:59.580
Some pirates will even lose their lives.

00:23:59.590 --> 00:24:03.000
And then, the lid of the treasure chest will finally be lifted!

00:24:03.000 --> 00:24:06.760
Next time on Treasure Island:
"A Treasure Is Good Only If You're Alive!"

00:24:06.760 --> 00:24:08.920
Who will get it if everybody is dead?

